<title>USA: Agouron sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Agouron sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc said Thursday its board of directors has approved a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the stock split will take the form of a special stock dividend of one share of common stock for each share of the common stock outstanding. The record date for the transaction is August 15, and the closing date will be on or about August 29.</p>
<p>At the end of June the company had about 14.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
